description_html:
The Seoul Golden Hands Festival will take place at the aT Center in Yangjae, Seoul from Dec. 3rd to 4th, 2016. The festival will showcase handmade goods from Seoul&rsquo;s artisans. &ldquo;Golden Hands&rdquo; is a newly coined phrase that refers to people who are skilled with working with their hands. The festival name is apt considering that all the goods and arts on display at the event will have been handmade by artisans.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
This unique event will feature a wide range of activities and goods from many young creators. Festival-goers will be able to browse and purchase goods bursting with personality! There will be everything from handicrafts, to design goods, beautifully decorated desserts, and more. Furthermore, visitors can shop figurines made and designed by incredible indie artists. The festival will also have an illustration exhibition and caricature corner.&nbsp;
